  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b9e3bf5d8c8534b4f3f360bcb8874b63b3099060\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b9e3bf5d8c8534b4f3f360bcb8874b63b3099060\" data-origin-width=\"1600\" data-origin-height=\"900\"></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/cc860cb96f280a2d0e10e5d59d6df40e31fb9102?download\" data-file-name=\"보석맵 가이드(4각형).pdf\" data-file-size=\"57937\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D134%26fileid%3D5%26regdt%3D20240510130528&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fcc860cb96f280a2d0e10e5d59d6df40e31fb9102')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">보석맵 가이드(4각형)</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">56.58KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c2e19aba9ef6408e03b573c0fc647ca0c8ad69ea?download\" data-file-name=\"보석맵 가이드(5각형).pdf\" data-file-size=\"1243043\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D134%26fileid%3D6%26regdt%3D20240510130528&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fc2e19aba9ef6408e03b573c0fc647ca0c8ad69ea')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">보석맵 가이드(5각형)</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">1.19MB</div></div></a></div><p>생물의 5계를 그냥 이론 수업으로 하기엔 아까워서 조별로 각 계를 정하고 보석맵을 그리게끔 하였습니다.</p><p>처음 시도할 경우 한시간으로는 끝나긴 힘들고(상황 설명을 해야 하기 때문),</p><p>1차시 반정도 잡으면 됩니다.(피드백까지 하시려면 2차시가 필요할 수도 있습니다.)</p><p>&#160;</p><p>유의할점은 학생들의 펜을 하나씩 고르도록 하고, 돌아가면서 쓰도록 해야 합니다.</p><p>같은 방향으로는 같은 생물에 대한 내용이 내려가도록 그려야 합니다.</p><p>(4~5명이 내용을 숙지하고 돌아가면서 써내려가야 합니다.)</p><p>5각형 모형도 파일로 둘테니 참고해주세요^^</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d0352fc70d77d3cb82e2cfb5b924ca83db6a1416\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d0352fc70d77d3cb82e2cfb5b924ca83db6a1416\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e72c21a12e27370f79b13c814380a1ef78440af1\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e72c21a12e27370f79b13c814380a1ef78440af1\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><p>5각형으로는 아직 수업 자료가 쌓이지 않아서, 1단원과, 5단원 내용을 첨부합니다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4861af45b8ace6bd776ec644351e48f22b76c145\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4861af45b8ace6bd776ec644351e48f22b76c145\" data-origin-width=\"1745\" data-origin-height=\"1125\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
